  "name": "AutopilotQR",
  "description": "AutopilotQR is a free, open-source browser app for Windows Autopilot device preparation - Device Association. Sign in with your Microsoft Entra tenant, scan the OOBE QR code, choose a policy, and pre-associate the device with Intune via Microsoft Graph without CSVs, USBs, or local installation. It runs entirely in your browser (MSAL PKCE) and can be self-hosted; early preview uses the Graph beta API and may change.",
